! _POC-XRAUTO RT01(IOL)= 試験のトラフィックの発信元。Loopback100 から SRV01 へ XR01・XR02 を通して流す。
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.11 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface Loopback100
 description traffic source
 ip address 198.51.100.1 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description to XR01
 ip address 10.0.11.2 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description to XR02
 ip address 10.0.21.2 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0011.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 passive-interface Loopback0
 passive-interface Loopback100
!
